<h3><u>Sajjad Sajjad</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Wa hussaina!!!<br />
Zindaa&#39;n se madine aakar bhi sajjad lahu rote hi rahe<br />
maa asghar ki suraj ke tale baithi rahi kitne din guzre<br />
Mukhtaar ne ek din di ye khabar, ye kehdo madar e asghar se<br />
maara gaya qatil asghar ka, ab dhup se shehzadi uthiye<br />
sajjad ne aakar maa se kaha, aye amma ab baitho na yaha<br />
ab thanda paani pilo maa, ab saaye me aao amma<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>tu khoo&#39;n rona jo chod de..(2)<br />
mai saaye mein aajaungi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad<br />
tu rat rona je chad de we, mai bhi tupnu chad jawangi</p>

<p>1. Sajjad zara insaaf te kar, aye hukm na de israar na kar<br />
eho soch ke hai fatwenda jigar, menda ujad gaya hai wasda ghar<br />
nit rowangi hud tup wich mai..(2), wich tupte ee marjawangi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>2. Mai takya e begoro kafan, tup wich baba mazloom tera<br />
nai tup jo uth sakdi bachda, tup band gayi ye maqsoom mera<br />
hid jad tak saawich samere..(2), wich tupte sog manawangi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>3. Maara gaya qatil asghar ka, asghar to nahi milne wala<br />
wo zakhmi gala jalta jhula, nasoor hai mere seene ka<br />
tu dil ko pakadna chod de..(2), mai saaye mein aajaungi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>4. Jo laashe husain te kita mai, wo waada tod nibhana hai<br />
majboor na kar meku puttar meda, meku saaya raas na aanaye<br />
muk jaane o do saamere..(2), jado chawe puttar me jawangi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>5. Haiwa ko bhi zibha hote hue, tu dekh nahi sakta beta<br />
kazzab zabeeho par apne, tujhe dekhke daalte hai parda<br />
ghash kha kar girna chod de..(2), mai saaye mein aajaungi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>6. Nai tup jo uthi jekar mai, tera vi rona nai mukya<br />
aji tay puttar sajjad tera, ankhiyada pani nai sukya<br />
tere wag de athru je thal gae, mai vicha mein wejawangi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>7. Mere waali tum shahid rehna, mazboot abhi tak waada hai<br />
saaye ki taraf jo leke chala, sajjad wo mera laasha hai<br />
zainab mera shana chod de..(2), mai saaye mein aajaungi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>8. Kar dafn rabab ku saina khe, oda pallu me ku khol wakha<br />
sajjad ne khol ke jad takya, gaya zainab de sang wo ghash khaa<br />
pallu wich chola asghar da..(2), naale raakh jhule diya lawangi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>

<p>9. Khurshid rehan nadeem deye, nit hasrat dil wich rendiye<br />
un pursa deiye ro roke, rayi tup wich jedi pendiye<br />
likhiye nauhe, padhiye nauhe..(2), hai saanj jado tak sawangi<br />
sajjad, sajjad, sajjad</p>
